            "text": " throw is 90 x 100 cm. Every row inserts the hook into the back loop of each dc, leaving the front loop exposed as a horizontal ridge. The fabric stretches more than regular dc."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aran weight gives the right balance of warmth and drape for a lap throw. The rib is subtle in smooth yarn and more pronounced in a slightly textured or tweedy aran. Total yardage is around 650 g."
          }
        ]
      },
